            <p><b>About this edition.</b> Native Media built this interactive edition to make the report easier to explore. It is not a PwC product, and PwC’s report is the authoritative source. Figures are taken from it with page references and checked against the PDF. Text marked “Native Media perspective” is our own interpretation.</p>
